 "description": "A delightful two double bedroom apartment on the fourth floor (lift) with a stunning west facing roof terrace with views down the River Thames.\n\n\rThis impeccably presented apartment sits in a prestigious riverside development, offering breath-taking panoramic views of the Thames and a genuinely unparalleled riverside lifestyle.\n\nSpanning over 900 square feet on the fourth floor, (with lift) the apartment features a spacious open-plan reception room where floor-to-ceiling glass doors open onto a generous south-facing roof terrace, the perfect spot for outdoor entertaining against a backdrop of stunning river views.\n\nThe sleek, modern kitchen is fully fitted and includes a breakfast bar alongside ample space for a family dining table. To the rear of the apartment, the primary bedroom benefits from an en-suite bathroom and built-in wardrobes, while a second double bedroom with built-in wardrobe and a family bathroom complete the accommodation.\n\nOyster Wharf is situated close to Clapham Junction (mainline) which provides fantastic transport links into Victoria and Waterloo.  Clapham Junction also provides a wide range of shops, bars and restaurants.  Battersea Square is close by and there is access both East and West via the Thames Path.",
